{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54653","headline":"兵要望江南 占天第十（十一首） 二 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占天第十（十一首） 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天气赤，荫地一般红。\n人物尽来如屠血，来兵必战有灾凶，兵败莫西东。\n（宋咸淳甲戌七月初六日庚辰酉时，在天有一丈余高霞，映地如血，当年十二月过江，至丙子纳降，江淮军民遭涂炭。\n）（按：此条原注爲後人附加。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54653.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54653","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}